   "line": 1,
   "text": "In the basement sits the old analog exchange, and this month it gets switched off. Your boss wants the new digital line to sound exactly the same. The manual describes its line filter: a Butterworth low-pass, cutoff thirty-four hundred hertz, where it passes seventy-one percent. A colleague's script turns that into a digital filter, the textbook recipe.",
