  {
   "line": 6,
   "text": "The squeeze never changes a gain. It only moves gains to new tones. So the copy passes seventy-one percent, exactly, at the tone where thirty-four hundred landed. Every gain is right, at the wrong tone. And once you know where each one lands, you can aim.",
