   "text": "Run the squeeze backward. Which analog frequency lands on thirty-four hundred? Forty-four hundred? Five thousand? Start at thirty-four hundred on the digital side, go across to the curve, then down to the analog frequency. Oh, ten thousand six hundred seven. More than three times higher, far above anything the line can carry. That's prewarping.",
